List<Thread> workers = startWorkers(orders);
for (Thread w : workers) {
    w.join();       // each worker reaches TERMINATED before we move on
}
generateReport();   // safe: every result is ready
```
*During each `join()`, `main` sits in `WAITING` until that worker is done.*

